      "description": "Christ, barefoot in a blue robe hatched with gold and with a gold halo, walks to the right carrying a large wooden cross over his shoulder. Behind him at the left stand three haloed mourners in blue, white and yellow and a soldier in a red tunic and dark helmet who holds the cross; at the right a man in a tan tunic, red cap and white hood grasps the cross beam and a soldier in a patterned red tunic and dark helmet is seen from behind. Flat colours with gold hatching on a transparent background.",
